   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Smart Crop & Stitch · FLUX.2 Klein 4B\nMask-only inpainting and editing for high-resolution images, by **HallettVisual**.\nNeeds the free **Smart Image Crop & Stitch** nodes: [GitHub](https://github.com/HallettVisual/ComfyUI-Smart-Image-Crop-and-Stitch) or ComfyUI Manager.\n\n## Quick start\n1. **Plate**: load your image and paint the area to change. Brush `B`, Erase `E`, Rect `R`, `[ ]` or **Alt+drag** to size the brush. The example image and mask are preloaded.\n2. **Prompt**: describe the change (tips below).\n3. **Run**. Only the masked area plus a little context goes to the model, at the model's native resolution. The result is stitched back with an automatic feather and colour match.\n4. **Image Comparer**: hover to slide between result (A) and original (B). **Send** puts the result back on the Plate for the next edit. **Save results** writes it to your output folder.\n\n## Models\n- `models/diffusion_models/` [flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors) (about 4 GB, runs on 8-12 GB cards. Full precision: flux-2-klein-4b)\n- `models/text_encoders/` [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors)\n- `models/vae/` [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n## Settings that matter\n- **Smart Image Crop**: min 1024 / max 1536 px. Small edits are upscaled so the model works at full detail; `context_padding` adds surrounding scene. The green box in *Crop preview* is what the model sees.\n- **Smart Image Stitcher**: `feather_mode` Auto scales the blend to the crop size; colour match 0.4 removes tone shifts.\n\n## Prompt tips · FLUX.2 Klein\n- Describe the finished area in plain sentences, change first: *\"Replace the glass with a baby bottle of warm milk...\"*\n- Say what must stay the same: lighting, colour, film grain, the hand holding it.\n- To remove something, describe what fills the gap (sky, wall, floor). *\"Remove X\"* on its own is weaker.\n- No negative prompt: distilled Klein runs at CFG 1, 4 steps. With the base models (`flux-2-klein-base-*`) use 20-30 steps and CFG 3-4.\n- 4B is the fast, light option. Switch to the 9B workflow for fine detail and lettering.\n\n## Masking tips\n- **Rect** for boxy objects, **Stamp** squares (256-2048) to judge how big an area is.\n- Paint a little past the object's edge; the stitch feathers into the surrounding pixels.\n- Big edits: raise `context_padding` (32-64) so the model sees more of the scene."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Smart Crop & Stitch · FLUX.2 Klein 4B\nMask-only inpainting and editing for high-resolution images, by **HallettVisual**.\nNeeds the free **Smart Image Crop & Stitch** nodes: [GitHub](https://github.com/HallettVisual/ComfyUI-Smart-Image-Crop-and-Stitch) or ComfyUI Manager.\n\n## Quick start\n1. **Plate**: load your image and paint the area to change. Brush `B`, Erase `E`, Rect `R`, `[ ]` or **Alt+drag** to size the brush. The example image and mask are preloaded.\n2. **Prompt**: describe the change (tips below).\n3. **Run**. Only the masked area plus a little context goes to the model, at the model's native resolution. The result is stitched back with an automatic feather and colour match.\n4. **Image Comparer**: hover to slide between result (A) and original (B). **Send** puts the result back on the Plate for the next edit. **Save results** writes it to your output folder.\n\n## Models\n- `models/diffusion_models/` [flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors) (about 4 GB, runs on 8-12 GB cards. Full precision: flux-2-klein-4b)\n- `models/text_encoders/` [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors)\n- `models/vae/` [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n## Settings that matter\n- **Smart Image Crop**: min 1024 / max 2048 px. Small edits are upscaled so the model works at full detail; `context_padding` adds surrounding scene. The green box in *Crop preview* is what the model sees.\n- **Smart Image Stitcher**: `feather_mode` Auto scales the blend to the crop size; colour match 0.4 removes tone shifts."
